  {
    "step_title": "Docker access",
    "items": [
      {
        "desc": "xDocker runs as the package user <b>xdocker</b>, which cannot open the Docker socket by default. After installing, give it access once (see the README, section 'Native package'): create a <b>docker</b> group, add <b>xdocker</b> to it, and add a boot-up task in Task Scheduler that runs <code>chown root:docker /var/run/docker.sock</code> as root. Until then xDocker shows 'Docker not reachable'."
      }
    ]
  }
]
